Extension Manifest V2 Deprecation Unsupported Stage
Displays a warning that affected MV2 extensions were turned off due to the Manifest V2 deprecation and cannot be re-enabled.
Extension Tab Context Menu
Allowing extensions to add custom items when right-clicking a tab.
Region Capture cross-tab
Allows the Region Capture API to be used cross-tab. (Only has an effect if Region Capture is generally enabled.)
Skia Graphite
