Enables on-press triggers of DsePreload2
Use custom disk cache backend for HTTP Cache
Enables the experimental disk cache backend for HTTP Cache. This flag is overridden by the CacheEncryptionEnabled enterprise policy on supported platforms.
Audio Ducking
Allows Chrome to duck (attenuate) audio from other tabs.
Main Node Annotations
Uses Screen2x main content extractor to annotate the accessibility tree with the main landmark on the node identified as main.
Origin-keyed Agent Clusters by default
Select the default behaviour for the Origin-Agent-Cluster http header. If enabled, an absent header will cause pages to be assigned to an origin-keyed agent cluster, and to a site-keyed agent cluster when disabled. Documents whose agent clusters are origin-keyed cannot set document.domain to relax the same-origin policy.
