Automatically triggers a summary when the Glic button is clicked on a certain page (ex. PDF).
Glic Button Pressed State
Enables visual changes to the Glic entry button when Glic is open.
Glic Capture Region
Enables Glic to capture a region of the screen.
Glic Chrome Status Icon
Use the Chrome logo as glic OS status bar icon on Mac.
Glic Client Zoom Control
Enables the use of Chrome zoom keyboard controls in the Glic UI.
Glic Daisy chain new tabs
Daisy chains new tabs if the active tab when the new tab was create has an open glic side panel
Glic Use Toolbar Height Side Panel
Enables Glic to use the toolbar height side panel instead of content height side panel when enabled to use side panel
Glic Live Mode Only Glow
The Gemini glow around the web contents will only appear when in live mode, rather than being always on the current page.
Glic Multi-Instance Tab Context Menu
Enables the Glic context menu for the tabs in the tabstrip.
Glic Share Image
Enables the Create Image with Gemini context menu item
Glic Default Tab Context Setting
Controls whether tab context is enabled by default within new Glic sessions. Required for Side Panel.
Glic guest URL presets
Overrides the Bluebird environment URL used for Glic with user-configured values. Intended for manual testing only.
Glic Selection Prompt
