Glic disable actor safety checks
Disables actor safety checks in Glic. Use with extreme caution, intended for testing only.
Enable toolbar Gemini button on horizontal tab strip
Enables the toolbar Gemini button when the horizontal tab strip is enabled, and disables the tab strip Gemini button.
Glic Toolbar Button Location
Specifies the location of the toolbar Gemini button.
Glic Contextual Cueing v2 Auto Submit
Enable automatically submitting a suggested prompt when the v2 contextual cue UI for Glic is clicked.
Skills
Enables Skills in Gemini in Chrome
Enable Save and Fill
When enabled, show an option to offer saving and filling a credit card with a single click when users don't have any cards saved in Autofill.
Happy Eyeballs Version 3
Enables the Happy Eyeballs Version 3 algorithm. See https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-pauly-v6ops-happy-eyeballs-v3/
Enable Management Promotion Banner
Enables showing the management promotion banner on chrome://management page.
Enable OAuthMultilogin Cookies Binding
Enables binding of cookies returned from OAuthMultilogin to cryptographic keys.
Enable OAuthMultilogin Cookies Binding Server Experiment
When enabled, Chrome will send will send a specific URL parameter to Gaia to trigger the server-side experiment for binding the OAuthMultilogin cookies to cryptographic keys. This flag is meant to be used in conjunction with the 'Enable OAuthMultilogin Cookies Binding' flag.
Chrome Refresh Token Binding
Enables binding of Chrome refresh tokens to cryptographic keys.
Three Button Password Save Dialog
Provides a 'not now' button alongside the 'never' button on the save password dialog.
Block Root Window Accessible Name Change Event
This feature prevents the firing of accessible name change events on the Root Window of MacOS applications. By blocking these events, it ensures that changes to the accessible name of Root Window do not trigger notifications to assistive technologies. This can be useful in scenarios where frequent or unnecessary name change events could lead to performance issues or unwanted behavior in assistive applications.
throttle-main-thread-to-60hz
Throttle main thread updates to 60fps, even when VSync rate is higher.
Lens overlay side panel open in new tab
Enables open in new tab in the Lens overlay side panel.
Mark all credential as leaked
Will pop up the leaked check dialog on every password form submission. This should be used in combination with #improved-password-change-service to better test the improved password change service
Enable checkout amount extraction.
When enabled, Chrome will extract the checkout amount from the checkout page of the allowlisted merchant websites.
AXTree Fixing
When enabled, allows Chrome to dynamically fix the AXTree of sites. This is experimental and may cause breaking changes to users of assistive technology.
DevTools Project Settings
If enabled, DevTools will try to fetch project settings in the form of a `com.chrome.devtools.json` file from a well-known URI on local debugging targets.
Drop input events while paint-holding is active
Drop input events at the browser process until the process receives the first signal that the renderer has sent a frame to GPU.  This prevents accidental interaction with a page the user has not seen yet.
Revamped Delete Browsing Data dialog
Enables a revamped Delete Browsing Data dialog on Desktop. This includes UI changes and removal of the bulk password deletion option from the dialog.
Default Browser Changed OS Notification
Enables the framework to show OS Notification when Chrome is no longer the default browser.
Default Browser Framework
Enables the default browser framework.
Default Browser Prompt Surfaces
Enables using various default browser prompt surfaces.
Privacy Sandbox Ad Topics Content Parity
Enables the Ad Topics card in the Privacy Guide to be displayed. This flag also updates UI and text of the Ad Topics settings page and Topics Consent Dialog. All of these changes are subject to regional availability.
Enable Card Benefits in-product help bubble
Enables In-Product-Help that appears when at least one autofill credit card suggestion includes card benefits.
Chrome Web Store navigation throttle
When enabled, passes DM Token to the Chrome Web Store.
Align PDF default print settings with HTML
Align the default print settings for PDFs with those for HTML, including scaling and centering.
Enable URL filter interstitial V3
Enables URL filter interstitial V3 for Family Link users.
Emit device log record separately
Emits one log record per each supervision type, instead of a single combined value. No user-visible effect on other platforms than Android.
Merge device parental controls and Family Link prefs
Merges non-web filtering device parental controls settings with Family Link settings in the SupervisedUserPrefStore. No user-visible effect on other platforms than Android.
Use URL filtering service
Use the SupervisedUserUrlFilteringService to get URL filtering settings directly from supervision services instead of using PrefService. No user-visible effect on other platforms than Android.
Enable amount extraction testing
Enables testing of the result of checkout amount extraction. This flag will allow amount extraction to run on any website when a CC form is clicked.
Local Network Access Checks
Enables Local Network Access checks. See: https://chromestatus.com/feature/5152728072060928
Local Network Access Checks for WebRTC
Enable Local Network Access checks for WebRTC. Requires the #local-network-access-check flag to also be enabled See: https://chromestatus.com/feature/5065884686876672
Local Network Access Checks for WebSockets
Enable Local Network Access checks for WebSockets. Requires the #local-network-access-check flag to also be enabled See: https://chromestatus.com/feature/5197681148428288
Local Network Access Checks for WebTransport
Enable Local Network Access checks for WebTransport. Requires the #local-network-access-check flag to also be enabled See: https://chromestatus.com/feature/5126430912544768
Navigation links in the tab-sharing bar
Enables quick-navigation links to the captured and capturing tab in the tab-sharing bar.
Lens side panel new feedback
Enables a new feedback entry point in the Lens side panel.
Expiry duration for VCN enrollment strikes
When enabled, changes the amount of time required for VCN enrollment prompt strikes to expire.
Bundled Security Settings
Enables new Bundled Security Settings UI on chrome://settings/security. This new UI bundles all security settings into either an enhanced or standard bundle which should simplify the security settings page and also help simplify the user's decision.
Invalidate search engine choice after the install detects it has been transferred to a new device
When enabled, search engine choices made on what we assume was a different device will not be considered valid, leading to the choice screen potentially retriggering.
Block Cross Partition Blob URL Fetching
Blocks fetching of cross-partitioned Blob URL.
Enable immediate mediation for WebAuthn get requests
Enables immediate mediation for WebAuthn and passwords for a navigator.credentials.get() request. This will return a NotAllowedError if there are no credentials for a given get request. The request can also request passwords.
media-playback-while-not-visible permission policy
Enables the media-playback-while-not-visible permission policy. This permission policy will pause any media being played by any disallowed iframes which are not currently rendered. Seehttps://github.com/MicrosoftEdge/MSEdgeExplainers/blob/main/IframeMediaPause/iframe_media_pausing.md for more information.
Open Dragged Links in the Same Tab
Allows users to drag a single link to a tab to open in that tab.
Enable allow_user_override field for SiteSearchSettings policy
Enable the field that allows organizations to set a Site Search engine that can be overridden by the user.
Change scrolling scheduling to reduce checkerboarding
If enabled, scrolling that would generate blank frames will now prioritize the new content over scrolling with the intention of decreasing the amount of checkerboarded frames.
Page actions migration
Enables a new internal framework for driving page actions behavior.
Enable caching field classification predictions
When enabled, the field classification model uses runtime caching to not run models on the same inputs multiple times.
Disable the Autofill strike system
When enabled, the Autofill strike system will not block a feature from being offered.
Web App Install Element
Enables the <install> HTML element which allows web apps to be installed declaratively.
Web App Installation API
Enables the Web App Installation API which allows web apps to be installed programmatically using navigator.install().
Web App Migration API
Enables the API for same-site web app migrations.
Enable buy now pay later on Autofill for Klarna
When enabled, users will have the option to pay with buy now pay later with Klarna on specific merchant webpages.
Customize tab group color palette
Enables parsing of the `tab_group_color_palette` key in the manifest.json file, which allows customization of the tab group color palette. Disabling this flag will cause the key to be ignored.
Lens overlay permission bubble alt appearance
Enables Lens overlay permission bubble alt appearance.
Enable showing in-product help UI for downstream card awareness
When enabled, in-product help UI will be shown the first time a card added outside of Chrome appears in Autofill card suggestions.
Enable new tab page browser feature suggestions
Shows suggestions to explore browser capabilities (eg. signing in) on the new tab page.
Extensibility API support for deep-links within DevTools
Extends console.timestamp to support adding deep-links into the DevTools Performance Panel, which (when clicked) call into a DevTools extension
Enable buy now pay later for externally linked BNPL issuer
When enabled, users will have the option to pay with buy now pay later with externally linked issuer on specific merchant webpages.
Lens Overlay EDU action chip
Enables Lens Overlay EDU action chip. Intended for testing the chip itself, not its triggering criteria.
Lens overlay entrypoint label
Replaces the string used for the Lens overlay entrypoint label.
Safety Hub - Disruptive notification revocation
Enables autorevoking notifications with high volume and low site engagement score
Safety Hub -  unused permission revocation from all surfaces
Enables autorevoking of unused permissions granted from all UI surfaces.
Bookmark and tab group conversion
Enable conversion between bookmark and tab group
Webium
Webium Prototype Browser.
Webium,AttachUnownedInnerWebContents,ExtensionsMenuAccessControl
Default search engine prewarm
Performance optimization to prewarm the default search engine used in the Omnibox
Apply clientside model predictions for password forms.
Enable using clientside model predictions to fill password forms.
HTML-in-Canvas
Enables the Canvas 2D drawElement API and the WebGL texElement2D API for drawing HTML content into a canvas. See: https://github.com/WICG/html-in-canvas
Enforce management disclaimer
When enabled, all signed in profiles that never saw the management disclaimer will be shown the management disclaimer when they open Chrome. Every time the primary signed in account changes to a managed account, the management disclaimer will be shown.
Lens overlay force empty CSB query
Forces Lens overlay to issue an empty CSB query on invocation.
Browsing History Actor Integration M2
Enables the browsing history glic actor integration M2.
Browsing History Actor Integration M3
Enables the browsing history glic actor integration M3. Requires browsing-history-actor-integration-M2 to be enabled as well.
Browsing History Grouping Improvements
Enables improvements to grouping of similar browsing history on the history page.
Autofill manual testing data
When set, imports the addresses and cards specified on startup. WARNING: If at least one address/card is specified, all other existing addresses/cards are overwritten.
autofill-profiles-content-for-manual-testing
Add new tabs to active tab group.
If enabled, and there is a tab group is focused, then new tabs will be added to the focused tab group.
Support for name and email addresses in Autofill
When enabled, a name and email profile with data comming from the account will be created for autofilling.
Force iOS Promo Type
Force the iOS promo to be a specific type (QRCode or Reminder) for testing purposes.
Mobile Promo On Desktop - QRCode
When enabled, shows a mobile promo with a QR code on desktop for eligible users.
Mobile Promo On Desktop - Reminder
When enabled, shows a mobile promo with a reminder flow on desktop for eligible users.
Reintroduce hybrid passkey entry point
Reintroduces the hybrid passkey entry point to the Autofill dropdown menu.
Lens overlay text selection context menu entrypoint
Enables invoking the Lens overlay from the selected text context menu.
Make options menus to include more tab group actions
Add options to menus to facilitate tab group creation and interaction
Tab group header hover cards
Enables hover cards for tab group headers in the tab strip.
Show tab group colours of tabs in Mac top bar menu
Show tab group colours of tabs that are in tab groups in the 'tabs' and'windows' menu' of the Mac OS menu bar
Enable SecurityInfo in WebRequest API for ControlledFrame
Enables SecurityInfo in WebRequest API for ControlledFrames, allowing listeners to retrieve certificate details of web requests.
Source-Specific Multicast in Direct Sockets API
Enables Source-Specific Multicast support in Direct Sockets API. See https://github.com/WICG/direct-sockets/blob/main/docs/multicast-explainer.md for details.
Enable Cross-Device Pref Tracker
Enables the tracking and sharing of select non-syncing preference values across a user's signed-in devices.
Contextual suggestions UI improvements
Enables UI improvements for contextual suggestions (e.g. icon and animation).
Verify QWACs
Enables verification of qualified certificates for website authentication as described in ETSI TS 119 411-5 V2.1.1 (2025-02).
Prefer blocklists instead of allowlists for Payments Autofill Buy Now Pay Later (BNPL)
When enabled, Payments Autofill Buy Now Pay Later (BNPL) will use each corresponding issuer's blocklist instead of allowlist to check for website eligibility.
Enable AI-based checkout amount extraction on Chrome
When enabled, Chrome will extract the checkout amount from the checkout page using server-side AI.
Create new tab group menu option at the top level of the app menu
In the app menu, add an option to create a new tab group at the top level
Enable issuer names in the second line of a BNPL suggestion
When enabled, the second line of a BNPL suggestion is updated to include the issuer names for better brand recognition.
Cryptography Compliance (CNSA)
If enabled, Chrome will configure its preferred algorithms for TLS to prefer algorithms that satisfy the requirements of the Commercial National Security Algorithm Suite (CNSA) versions 1.0 and 2.0. Enabling this flag does not guarantee that any specific algorithms will be negotiated. This flag is not required for security.
Lens search reinvocation affordance
Enables the Lens button in the AIM Searchbox for reinvocation of selection overlay.
Lens updated feedback entrypoint
Enables an updated feedback entry point in the Lens side panel.
Lens video citations
Enables special handling for video citations in Lens.
Prioritize save card bubble over mandatory re-auth
When enabled, this flag prioritizes showing the save card bubble over the mandatory re-auth bubble when both are applicable.
Variations seed corpus
The value of the 'corpus' parameter in the variations seed request. If unspecified, the 'corpus' parameter is omitted from the request.
Passkey Unlock Manager
Enables the Passkey Unlock Manager, which tracks the state of passkeys and publishes the corresponding metrics.
Passkey Unlock Error UI
Enables showing the passkey unlock error UI to passkey users in case when their access to passkeys is 
locked
 and when they have an available user verification mechanism (either a system UV or a GPM PIN). This flag requires the flag `PasskeyUnlockManager` to be active.
Automatic JS Optimizer Control
Adds an option to the V8 optimizer content setting that disables the JavaScript optimizer on sites that are unfamiliar to the user.
ServiceWorkerSyntheticResponse
Enable service worker synthetic response feature.
Default Browser settings page - updated strings
Improves the flow and the wording on the Default Browser settings page.
Mdm error handling for dasher accounts
Enables the mdm error handling feature for dasher accounts
Disable U18 Feedback Desktop
Disables the feedback for U18 users on desktop platforms.
Enable CTA experiment for sign-in level up
As part of the Sign In Level Up experiment, changes the decline sign in CTA string in profile creation entry points
Search Settings Update
Enables refactoring of the search settings pages in chrome://settings/search
Show profile picker to all users
As part of the Growth experiments, show the profile picker to users who only have one profile
Profile Signals Reporting Enabled
Enables the profile signals reporting flow for Chrome Enterprise.
Projects Panel
Enables the Projects Panel.
Sync AI Threads
Acquire AI Threads via sync.
Sync Gemini Threads
Acquire Gemini Threads via sync.
Enable UnexportableKeyService mojo service in the browser process.
When enabled, the browser process will create an Unexportable Key Service which can be used by other, less privileged processes. This enables DBSC in platforms where access to TPM-like features is privileged.
Profile Picker Text Variations
As part of the Profile experiments, enables variations of the profile picker text.
Lens Overlay optimization filter
Enables using the optimization filter for triggering the action chip.
Migrate preinstalled Chat app
When enabled, the preinstalled Chat web app will be migrated from its old URL to a new URL. This migration only applies to users who have not manually installed the Chat app.
Web App install dialog
Enables the new web app install dialog.
Connection Allowlists
Enables a prototype implementation of `Connection-Allowlist` header parsing and enforcement. See https://github.com/mikewest/anti-exfil/
Reading Mode Experimental Webpage Distilation
Enables the experimental text webpage distillation using readability.js method for reading mode.
Reading Mode Omnibox Chip
Enables the omnibox chip entry point for Reading mode
Enable Unexportable Key Deletion
Enables the garbage collection and deletion of obsolete cryptographic keys used for Device Bound Session Credentials.
Disable the country check for BNPL testing
Enables testing BNPL in countries where it would otherwise be disabled.
Infobar Prioritization
Shows the infobars by priority starting by critical ones by respecting a given caps.
Infobar Refresh
Renders infobars with a refreshed UI.
Reading Mode Experimental Immersive Mode
Enables the infrastructure for Immersive Reading Mode.
Lens overlay non-blocking privacy notice
Enables non-blocking privacy notice in the Lens overlay.
Lens overlay non-blocking privacy notice for image search
Enables non-blocking privacy notice in the Lens overlay when invoked from the image context menu.
Migrate syncing user to signed in state
When enabled, a syncing user is migrated to the signed in non-syncing state on the next browser startup.
Undo the migration of syncing users to signed-in state
When enabled, reverts the migration of syncing users who were previously migrated to the signed-in, non-syncing state.
DOM Storage SQLite Backend
Uses a SQLite-powered backing store for local and session storage. No data is migrated from existing backing stores, including LevelDB stores or SQLite stores with older schemas; use at your own peril.
IDB SQLite Backing Store
Uses a SQLite-powered backing store for IndexedDB. No data is migrated from existing backing stores, including LevelDB stores or SQLite stores with older schemas; use at your own peril.
Overscroll effect on non-root scrollers
Enables elastic overscroll effect on scrollers other than the root document (e.g. iframes and overflow areas).
Your Saved Info settings page
Enables the experimental "Your saved info" settings page, replacing the existing "Autofill and passwords" page.
Enable text editing through accessibility APIs
Enables support for performing text editing operations through the AXTextOperation accessibility API.
Enable Chrome Web Store Promotion Banner
Enables showing the promotion banner on chromewebstore page.
Enable Okta SSO for enterprise browsers.
Enables native support for Okta SSO on managed MacOS devices.
Update Google Pay branding to Wallet where applicable
When enabled, certain strings and logos referencing Google Account, Google Payments, and Google Pay will instead reference Google Wallet.
Enable Private User Metrics
Enables collection of Private User Metrics.
Enable Private User Metrics for Regional Capabilities
Enables collection of Private User Metrics for Regional Capabilities. For it to work, Private User Metrics need to be enabled too.
Enable ignore AI-based Amount Extraction Terms Acknowledgement
When enabled, the BNPL flow acts as if the user has not yet seen or the AI terms. This allows the AI terms to be shown repeatedly for testing purposes, regardless of the actual stored user preference.
Autofill AI always trigger server model
Queries the server model for every form encountered, ignoring server-side instructions. Intended for testing only.
Autofill AI available by default
Makes Autofill AI available by default, with the enable toggle controlling online model runs and logging.
Autofill AI create entity data manager
Ensures the EntityDataManager for Autofill AI is created regardless of other feature states. Useful for data cleanup.
Autofill AI dedupe entities
Enables periodic deduplication of Autofill AI entities.
Autofill AI no filling icons experiment
If enabled, Autofill AI filling suggestions do not have an icon.
Autofill AI re-authentication required
Requires re-authentication when filling or viewing sensitive fields with Autofill AI.
Autofill AI server model
Allows the client to trigger the server model for Autofill AI type predictions.
IPH Autofill AI Valuables
Enables the In-Product Help for Autofill AI valuables.
Autofill AI Google Wallet flight reservations
Enables Autofill AI support for flight reservation entities from Google Wallet.
Autofill AI Google Wallet private passes
Enables Autofill AI support for private passes from Google Wallet.
Autofill AI Google Wallet private passes deep link
Enables Autofill AI support for deep linking to private passes from Google Wallet.
Autofill AI Google Wallet vehicle registration
Enables Autofill AI support for vehicle registration entities from Google Wallet.
Autofill AI with data schema
Enables the second iteration of Autofill AI, which uses a more advanced data schema.
Reading Mode Line Focus
Enables the experimental line focus mode for Reading mode.
Verify MTCs
Enables verification of Merkle Tree Certificates as described in https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-davidben-tls-merkle-tree-certs/. Requires #tls-trust-anchor-ids.
Password Upload UI Update
Adds new entry points for uploading passwords to account storage and updates existing ones.
Saas Usage Reporting
Enable reporting of SaaS usage. This feature only takes effect if a related enterprise policy is also configured by an administrator.
Enable Pay Now Pay Later tabs UI for payments autofill on Chrome
When enabled, Chrome will use the Pay Now Pay Later tabs UI for payments autofill when buy now pay later options are available for the merchant webpage.
Enable Ambient sign-in for WebAuthn get requests
Enables ambient sign-in for passkeys and passwords from a navigator.credentials.get() request. This is similar to conditional UI with the main difference being it does not use autofill UI.
Enable protocol monitor in DevTools
Enables the protocol monitor panel, which displays the Chrome DevTools Protocol (CDP) traffic between DevTools and the browser.
WebMCP support in DevTools
Enables WebMCP support in DevTools.
Bundled Security Settings Secure Dns V2
Enables Secure DNS V2 setting in the bundles on the chrome://settings/security page. The setting will move from the advanced section to the bundled section.
Stop resending LaunchParams on user reload
Disables the Launch Queue re-sending LaunchParams on reloads.
Credential Management Unified UI
Enables the Unified UI for the credential management password APIs.
Use explicit-choice dialog confirming new search engine overrides
When enabled, web searches with a newly-installed search engine-overriding extension will be deferred until a new explicit-choice dialog confirms the change is intentional.
Always show confirmation dialog for new search engine overrides
When enabled, all newly-installed search engine-overriding extensions encounter the confirmation dialog (exceptions for some extensions are removed).
WebMCP for testing
Enables the WebMCP API and its associated testing interfaces.
Enable new American Express network art
When enabled, updates the American Express network art in Autofill.
Chrome Finds Internals
Enables the chrome://chrome-finds-internals page.
Preserve HTTP message bodies across navigations for DevTools
Enables a durable message storing mechanism, which allows preserving HTTP message bodies for debugging.
Unthrottle async touch moves
When enabled, touch move events to javascript handlers are unthrottled if they are sent as async to Renderer.
Horizontal Tab Strip Combo Button
Enables the combo button in the horizontal tab strip.
Mobile NTP Promo on Desktop
Enables the Mobile NTP Promo on Desktop.
Sign in promo on avatar pill
Feature that shows a Sign in promo on the avatar pill at startup
Mobile Promo On Desktop - QR Code (Wave 1)
When enabled, shows a mobile promo with a QR code on desktop for eligible users. This version highlights features not included in the existing Mobile promos.
Mobile Promo On Desktop - Reminder (Wave 1)
When enabled, shows a mobile promo with a reminder flow on desktop for eligible users. This version highlights features not included in the existing mobile promos.
Enable Omnibox Autofill chip for payments
When enabled, an Autofill payments omnibox chip will appear for relevant payment checkout forms.
Further update Google Pay and Google Wallet branding where applicable
When enabled, further brings certain strings and images referencing Google Pay and Google Wallet into consistency with branding requirements.
WebCrypto PQC
Enables Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) algorithms (ML-DSA and ML-KEM) and ChaCha20-Poly1305 in WebCrypto.
Defer OS Clipboard Read Call To GetType
Defers Async Clipboard Read API data retrieval from the OS until ClipboardItem.getType() is called, instead of eagerly fetching all formats at read() time.
Import and export flags
Enables importing and exporting flags from chrome://flags.
Use PersistentCache for Code Cache
Use PersistentCache backend for code cache for JavaScript and WebAssembly.
Inline Script Cache
Enables caching of inline scripts. This flag only works if #use-persistent-cache-for-code-cache is enabled.
Migrate Enhanced Safe Browsing User to Enhanced Bundle
Enables the migration of enhanced Safe Browsing users to the enhanced bundle. Requires chrome://flags#bundled-security-settings to be enabled.
Bookmarks Encryption
Enable encryption for bookmarks
Require a week between offers to save credit cards
When enabled, users should not see offers to save the same credit card twice in a week, as the strike database enforces a 7-day delay between strikes.
Enable Extensions Menu Teardown Fix
Enables a fix that defers extensions menu closure when an action is triggered from the menu.
Tabs from other devices side panel
Enables the tabs from other devices side panel.
UserMediaElement
Enables the <usermedia> element, allowing sites to embed a camera/microphone permission request directly in the page.
Reading Mode Select Text with Readability
Enables the select text feature for readability distillation
Energy Effect
Enables the Energy Effect for the Realbox.
Energy Effect Animation
Enables animations for the Energy Effect for the Realbox.
Ask-Before-HTTP in Bundled Security Settings
Includes Ask-Before-HTTP (HTTPS-First Mode) in the Enhanced security bundle.
Enable travel category and merchant benefits from Curinos
When enabled, travel category and merchant benefits sourced from Curinos will be shown in Autofill.
Cancel file uploads on content analysis
Allows users to cancel file uploads while content analysis is in progress.
Reject Payment Request in small windows
Reject Payment Request and Payment Handler dialogs if the browser window is too small to contain them.
